<title>POLAND: STOMIL NET FALLS TO PLN 6.55 MLN.</title>
<headline>STOMIL NET FALLS TO PLN 6.55 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     6.55 vs   7.87</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 9.32 vs  12.14</p>
<p> Operating profit     9.10 vs  10.36</p>
<p> Sales		   70.17 vs  54.93</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    46.11 vs  62.15</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	69.51 vs  76.98</p>
<p> Operating profit    63.42 vs  75.08</p>
<p> Sales		  579.58 vs 441.58</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish tyre maker is Stomil Olsztyn SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
